---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { imageDimensions } from '../data/media';
---
<section class="question-preview" aria-labelledby="question-preview-title">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">A choice in the middle of the work</p><h2 id="question-preview-title">The task asks.<br /><em>The answer gets back.</em></h2><p>In a controlled native run, Claude asks which direction a workshop plan should take. The selected answer reaches the original question call, and the same task continues.</p><blockquote><span>The recorded choice</span><strong>Quick setup</strong><p>The final plan names that direction and gives three practical steps.</p></blockquote><a class="button button-dark" href="/labs/question/">Follow the native question <Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></a><p class="question-preview-scope">iPhone Simulator · automated participant · real Claude inference through a local API shim. This isolated build includes an unreleased answer-key correction. The plan’s actions were not carried out.</p></div>
  <figure><a href="/media/question/question.png" aria-label="Open the full native question capture"><img src="/media/question/question.png" {...imageDimensions('/media/question/question.png')} alt="The native chat shows a real question with Quick setup and More customization options." loading="lazy" /></a><figcaption>The actual native question, waiting for its answer.</figcaption></figure>
</section>
<style>
  .question-preview{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:70px;padding:35px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#e9ecdf;border-radius:4px;align-items:center}.question-preview .eyebrow{color:var(--rust);margin-bottom:18px}.question-preview h2{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,3.4vw,3.6rem);line-height:1.12;margin-bottom:22px}.question-preview h2 em{color:var(--forest)}.question-preview p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.75}.question-preview blockquote{margin:22px 0;padding:15px 19px;border-left:3px solid var(--forest);background:var(--paper)}.question-preview blockquote>span{display:block;font-size:.62rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--muted)}.question-preview blockquote>strong{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:500;margin-block:5px}.question-preview blockquote p{font-size:.8rem}.question-preview .button{font-size:.78rem}.question-preview .question-preview-scope{font-size:.67rem;margin-top:16px;max-width:510px;line-height:1.65}.question-preview figure{margin:0;justify-self:center;width:min(100%,235px)}.question-preview img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid var(--line)}.question-preview figcaption{font-size:.65rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;text-align:center}
  @media(max-width:800px){.question-preview{gap:28px;padding:25px}.question-preview h2{font-size:2.4rem}.question-preview p{font-size:.85rem}}
  @media(max-width:600px){.question-preview{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px;padding:22px 18px}.question-preview h2{font-size:2.2rem}.question-preview figure{width:min(75%,220px)}.question-preview .question-preview-scope{font-size:.66rem}}
</style>
